  "details": "When I put texts on avatar, world, or group's description, the punctuation is \"replaced\" somewhat mangled characters.\n\nFor example, &#33; (the exclamation mark) to &#41; (Close parenthesis) are replaced to U+FF01 to U+FF09 (defined in Unicode's Halfwidth and Fullwidth Forms block).\n\nThis make it difficult to paste BOOTH's URLs, which start with https://booth.pm/ .",
